[E0462] Error: `looked` is not a `var fn`, and has no receiver to empty
    ╭─[ err/553_empties_misplaced/main.wip:11:14 ]
    │
 11 │     fn looked() empties = {}
    │                 ───┬───
    │                    ╰───── `empties` here
    │
    │ Note: `empties` says a call leaves the receiver holding no view, so only a method that changes its receiver, a `var fn`, says it
────╯
